// Which net reacts to which event (§16.2). A project's nets/bindings binds at project scope; a line with
// `where agent in {..}` at agent scope; the narrowest binding wins.
on owner_message use owner_message
on turn_end use turn_end
on agent_message use agent_message
// The agents' watch (vault designs/supervision-nets-2026-11-10.md): a clock, not an event; its tells stay dry.
every 30m use agent_watch
